  "short": "POV: you just quickly checked your phone. 📱\n\nIn Deep Work, Cal Newport describes attention residue (an idea from researcher Sophie Leroy): when you switch tasks, part of your attention stays on the last one. Finish one task before switching, and keep your phone away during deep work.\n\n💬 Where does your phone live while you work?\n🧠 Follow @lobelessons for one book lesson every day.\n\n#deepwork #calnewport #focus #productivity #booklessons #mindset #booksummary #pov #lobelessons",
